SUMMARY:Helium v3.2.5
DESCRIPTION:Helium 3.2.5 | TrollStore\n\nMassive merge of features from [As
 akuraFuuko's repo](https://github.com/AsakuraFuuko/Helium)\n\n**Top featur
 es from v3.0.0-v3.2.5 include:**\n- Landscape mode now works properly!\n- 
 Massive improvements to the adaptive color functionality\n- Choosing the t
 ext font\n- Option for italic text\n- Update interval can be controlled fo
 r each widget\n- New weather widget (must set your own API key)\n- Enablin
 g and disabling widget sets\n- HUD now updates widget sets without having 
 to restart the HUD\n- Option for a debug border around the widgets\n- Date
  locale fixes for Chinese users\n- Chinese translation\n- A whole lot of o
 ther improvements/fixes\n\nOnce again\, thank you so much to AsakuraFuuko 
 for this huge update. I would like to welcome them to the development team
 \, where they will hopefully continue to update the app! Keep an eye out f
 or this up-and-coming dev 👀
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/helium.json
